From 63c338152d55cdb225867312de589ad3d606d786 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:38:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Client viewer: redesigned layout (top navbar, calendar,
 flight library, video pop-up, compare)

Brings the redesigned project-viewer layout from the captureiv-2 work into
production's viewer, adapted to production's access rules:
- Top navbar with Project Viewer + code chip, tabs, search and Share;
  white sidebar with a date calendar; full-height site map with Compare
  (drag divider), Flight Library and a video pop-up; logo in the footer.
- Tabs are only those the project link permits (Flight Scans, Media,
  Photos) via a new viewer_tabs list; clients still never get documents.
  Production's Photos tab is kept, and production's site-boundary and
  photo-coverage drawing were added to the viewer map script.
- The viewer loads its own base stylesheet (viewer-base.css) plus the
  redesign CSS, so no other production page changes. viewer-refresh.css
  (the interim restyle) is removed.
- Test wording updated for the new tab and heading labels.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
